</span></td>
<td id="S3.T2.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T2.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Fairness, robustness, accountability, and resilience</span>
</span></td>
