<span id="S3.T2.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:227.6pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Serve as engines that transform data into insights. Embedding ethical checks and explainability mechanisms in algorithm design helps SMEs avoid bias, prevent discriminatory outcomes, and ensure outputs are both efficient and trustworthy.</span>
</span></td></tr>
