<span id="S3.T2.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Secure-by-design, transparency, alignment with context</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T2.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
